 ["h2", "bukan-postur", "Masalahnya bukan (hanya) postur", "The problem is not (just) posture"],
 ["p", "Selama bertahun-tahun kita diajari bahwa leher kaku disebabkan postur yang buruk. Bukti ilmiahnya ternyata lebih lemah dari itu. Tulisan di Journal of Orthopaedic & Sports Physical Therapy menyimpulkan bahwa tidak ada satu postur \"ideal\" yang terbukti mencegah nyeri, dan postur yang beragam serta nyaman justru lebih masuk akal [3].",
  "For years we were taught that a stiff neck comes from bad posture. The evidence turns out to be weaker than that. A paper in the Journal of Orthopaedic & Sports Physical Therapy concluded that no single 'ideal' posture has been shown to prevent pain, and that varied, comfortable postures make more sense [3]."],
 ["p", "Yang lebih sering terjadi: kepala ditahan di posisi yang sama selama berjam-jam, otot leher dalam dan bahu tidak cukup kuat untuk menahan beban statis itu, lalu beban kerja naik — tenggat, rapat daring beruntun, tidur yang terpotong. Nyeri muncul bukan karena satu posisi salah, tapi karena satu posisi tidak pernah berganti.",
  "What usually happens: the head is held in one position for hours, the deep neck and shoulder muscles are not conditioned for that static load, and then the workload rises — deadlines, back-to-back video calls, broken sleep. Pain appears not because one position is wrong, but because one position never changes."],

